%% Imzo: enrolling a device. Both screens must show the same six-digit code.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Administrator
  participant W as Bank app (laptop)
  participant S as Approval service
  participant D as Imzo app (phone)
  A->>W: start enrolment (already logged in)
  W->>S: POST /devices/enrol/start
  S-->>W: challenge (session, nonce, org)
  W->>D: challenge QR frames (kind en)
  D->>D: create P-256 key in Keystore, user sets PIN
  D->>D: sign nonce + org (proof of possession)
  D->>W: answer QR frames (kind er): public key, signature, optional attestation chain
  W->>S: POST /devices/enrol/finish
  S->>S: verify proof, derive six-digit code from the public key
  S-->>W: code + status pending confirm
  Note over D,W: Both screens show the same code. A swapped key changes the code.
  A->>A: compare the two codes
  A->>S: confirm (hackathon) / second administrator activates (pilot)
  S-->>W: device ACTIVE
